00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:05.690
It's a good indicator of low potassium and
you need to increase that and you're drift

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:06.690
off.

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:11.300
Really what causes a potassium deficiency
is really two things.

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:16.060
One is stress for many years, because stress
will deplete your potassium, the adrenal or

00:03:16.060 --> 00:03:17.890
number two) sugar.

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:21.739
You eat too much sugar, it'll definitely deplete
your potassium and your pulse rate will go

00:03:21.739 --> 00:03:24.980
higher, and higher, and higher.

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:25.980
Okay?

